  "notes": [
    "**Llevarse** is a reflexive verb based on **llevar** (to carry/take)",
    "Regular -AR verb pattern with reflexive pronouns",
    "No stem changes in any tense",
    "Past participle: llevado (taken away/carried off)",
    "**Multiple meanings:**",
    "Very common in Argentina for describing theft: *Los ladrones se llevaron todo* (The robbers took everything)",
    "Can also mean to take someone/something with you: *Me llevo el paraguas* (I'm taking the umbrella with me)"
